   348	>
   349	> Aftercare can include surgeon reviews, blood tests, dietitian support, supplements where prescribed and help adapting eating. Over 10 years, experiences vary: some people maintain changes, some regain weight, develop nutritional issues or need further treatment. No single 10-year result can be promised, so ongoing follow-up remains important.
   350	>
