   354	>
   355	> **10. I have had weight loss surgery before — can it be revised?**
   356	>
   357	> Revision surgery may be discussed after a previous procedure when there are complications, a need for conversion or another clinical reason. It can involve different risks and follow-up from a first procedure, so the surgeon needs to review your operative history and current health before advising.
