   315	>
   316	> **11. What can happen over 10 years after weight loss surgery?** Long-term experiences vary. Some people maintain changes, while others regain weight, develop nutritional issues or need further treatment; ongoing medical, dietary and supplement follow-up may remain important. Your surgeon can discuss the evidence and what your health and follow-up plan may mean for you, but no single 10-year outcome can be promised.
