256:> BMI 30-34 with a weight-related health condition: this range does not meet the MBS threshold for these items. Your surgeon can assess your broader clinical picture and discuss non-MBS options where appropriate; a condition below BMI 35 does not by itself establish eligibility for MBS-funded surgery.
258:Why it matters: A major comorbidity is relevant to the MBS pathway at BMI 35+, not as a below-35 qualification route.
